Terminals unused in grammar

    RESERVED
    ARROW


Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE ProgramMembers RBRACE

    2 ProgramMembers: ProgramMembers ProgramMember
    3               | ε

    4 ProgramMember: MethodDecl
    5              | FieldDecl
    6              | SEMICOLON

    7 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    8 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IDENTIFIER FieldDeclTail SEMICOLON
    9          | error SEMICOLON

   10 FieldDeclTail: FieldDeclTail COMMA IDENTIFIER
   11              | ε

   12 Type: BOOL
   13     | INT
   14     | DOUBLE

   15 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamsOpt RPAR
   16             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamsOpt RPAR

   17 FormalParamsOpt: FormalParams
   18                | ε

   19 FormalParams: STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER
   20             | Type IDENTIFIER FormalParamsTail

   21 FormalParamsTail: FormalParamsTail COMMA Type IDENTIFIER
   22                 | ε

   23 MethodBody: LBRACE MethodBodyItems RBRACE

   24 MethodBodyItems: MethodBodyItems MethodBodyItem
   25                | ε

   26 MethodBodyItem: VarDecl
   27               | Statement

   28 VarDecl: Type IDENTIFIER VarDeclTail SEMICOLON

   29 VarDeclTail: VarDeclTail COMMA IDENTIFIER
   30            | ε

   31 Statement: MatchedStatement
   32          | UnmatchedStatement

   33 MatchedStatement: LBRACE StatementList RBRACE
   34                 | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement ELSE MatchedStatement
   35                 | WHILE LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement
   36                 | RETURN ExprOpt SEMICOLON
   37                 | MethodInvocation SEMICOLON
   38                 | Assignment SEMICOLON
   39                 | ParseArgs SEMICOLON
   40                 | SEMICOLON
   41                 | PRINT LPAR PrintArg RPAR SEMICOLON
   42                 | error SEMICOLON

   43 UnmatchedStatement: IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR Statement
   44                   | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement ELSE UnmatchedStatement
   45                   | WHILE LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR UnmatchedStatement

   46 StatementList: StatementList Statement
   47              | ε

   48 ExprOpt: ExprOrAssign
   49        | ε

   50 PrintArg: ExprOrAssign
   51         | STRLIT

   52 MethodInvocation: IDENTIFIER LPAR ExprListOpt RPAR
   53                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR

   54 ExprListOpt: ExprList
   55            | ε

   56 ExprList: ExprOrAssign
   57         | ExprList COMMA ExprOrAssign

   58 Assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN ExprOrAssign

   59 ParseArgs: PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ ExprOrAssign RSQ RPAR
   60          | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   61 ExprOrAssign: Assignment
   62             | Expr

   63 Expr: Expr PLUS Expr
   64     | Expr MINUS Expr
   65     | Expr STAR Expr
   66     | Expr DIV Expr
   67     | Expr MOD Expr
   68     | Expr AND Expr
   69     | Expr OR Expr
   70     | Expr XOR Expr
   71     | Expr LSHIFT Expr
   72     | Expr RSHIFT Expr
   73     | Expr EQ Expr
   74     | Expr GE Expr
   75     | Expr GT Expr
   76     | Expr LE Expr
   77     | Expr LT Expr
   78     | Expr NE Expr
   79     | MINUS Expr
   80     | PLUS Expr
   81     | NOT Expr
